data: {"id": "896f049c6ce24269-thinking-parallel_evidence-4006", "run_id": "896f049c6ce24269", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已根据已收集的工具结果，对 `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462` 的状态和 CrashLoopBackOff 的直接原因进行分析。\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n*   **Pod**: `workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462` (Namespace: `aiops-case-08`)\n*   **UID**: `7f2eda43-58bc-4f48-bb8a-02435553f7d1`\n*   **节点**: `node2` (IP: 10.2.0.50)\n*   **控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-5c9c7b6489`\n*   **容器**: `app` (Image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, Command: `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`)\n\n### 2. 支持“CrashLoopBackOffRuntime”且直接原因为 OOMKilled 的事实\n以下证据链条完整", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789085345208, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

